             <span id="alg1.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg1.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\sigma^{(t)}\geq\theta_{\sigma}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>σ</mi><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></msup><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>θ</mi><mi>σ</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\sigma^{(t)}\geq\theta_{\sigma}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg1.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg1.l15.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg1.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Hard constraint on copying score only
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg1.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
               <span id="alg1.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>

</div>
