            <span id="alg2.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else<span id="alg2.l16.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Handle samples without answer annotations
</span></span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{D}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}\cup\{(Q_{i}\oplus C_{i},r_{i}^{*},r^{-}):r^{-}\in\mathcal{R}_{i}^{f}\setminus\{r_{i}^{*}\}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><msub><mi>Q</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>⊕</mo><msub><mi>C</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo rspace="0.278em" stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo rspace="0.278em">:</mo><mrow><msup><mi>r</mi><mo>−</mo></msup><mo>∈</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℛ</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi></msubsup><mo>∖</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi>r</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>∗</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{D}\leftarrow\mathcal{D}\cup\{(Q_{i}\oplus C_{i},r_{i}^{*},r^{-}):r^{-}\in\mathcal{R}_{i}^{f}\setminus\{r_{i}^{*}\}\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l17.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Use original responses without answer appending
