</div>
<div id="alg2.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
          Initialize <math id="alg2.l20.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg2.l20.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\text{ref}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\text{ref}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l20.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l20.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> DPO training with <math id="alg2.l20.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="5N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mn>5</mn><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">5N</annotation></semantics></math> preference pairs from <math id="alg2.l20.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>N</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N</annotation></semantics></math> samples
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> not converged <span id="alg2.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> each <math id="alg2.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(x,y_{w},y_{l})\in\mathcal{D}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><mo>∈</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒟</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(x,y_{w},y_{l})\in\mathcal{D}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg2.l22.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg2.l22.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg2.l22.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Leverage 5× data efficiency: each sample yields 5 preference pairs
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l23" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">23:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg2.l23.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{L}=-\log\sigma\left(\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(y_{w}|x)}{\pi_{\text{ref}}(y_{w}|x)}-\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(y_{l}|x)}{\pi_{\text{ref}}(y_{l}|x)}\right)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo rspace="0.167em">−</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mrow><mi>σ</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo><mrow><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>w</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow><mo>−</mo><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo lspace="0.167em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo lspace="0.167em">⁡</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><mrow><msub><mi>π</mi><mtext>ref</mtext></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>y</mi><mi>l</mi></msub><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">|</mo><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{L}=-\log\sigma\left(\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(y_{w}|x)}{\pi_{\text{ref}}(y_{w}|x)}-\beta\log\frac{\pi_{\theta}(y_{l}|x)}{\pi_{\text{ref}}(y_{l}|x)}\right)</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l24" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">24:</span>
            
            
             Update <math id="alg2.l24.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\theta" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>θ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\theta</annotation></semantics></math> using <math id="alg2.l24.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\nabla_{\theta}\mathcal{L}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mo>∇</mo><mi>θ</mi></msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℒ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\nabla_{\theta}\mathcal{L}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg2.l25" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">25:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg2.l25.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l25.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l26" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">26:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l26.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg2.l26.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="alg2.l27" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">27:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg2.l27.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg2.l27.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\pi_{\theta}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>π</mi><mi>θ</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\pi_{\theta}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
<figure id="alg3" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg3.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 3</span> </span> Context-Parameter Copying Capturing</figcaption>
<div id="alg3.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg3.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          Given string of context <math id="alg3.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> and query, the LLM generates a token answer <math id="alg3.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{\text{ctx}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{\text{ctx}}</annotation></semantics></math> of length <math id="alg3.l1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>n</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">n</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>: logits distribution of the <math id="alg3.l1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th token, <math id="alg3.l1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{i}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{i}</annotation></semantics></math>: hidden states of the <math id="alg3.l1.m7" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math>-th token, <math id="alg3.l1.m8" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}</annotation></semantics></math>: vocabulary of LLM. <math id="alg3.l1.m9" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{\text{para}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{\text{para}}</annotation></semantics></math>: token answer generated without context, <math id="alg3.l1.m10" class="ltx_Math" alttext="K" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>K</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">K</annotation></semantics></math>: scope of knowledge capture.

</div>
<div id="alg3.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          Captured knowledge logits and hidden states <math id="alg3.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          Initialize <math id="alg3.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{ctx}},T_{\text{para}}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{ctx}},T_{\text{para}}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l3.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l3.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Token lists for captured tokens
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg3.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\text{com}}=\text{commonSubstringMatching}(C,A_{\text{para}})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>com</mtext></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>commonSubstringMatching</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>C</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\text{com}}=\text{commonSubstringMatching}(C,A_{\text{para}})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l4.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l4.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Identify common substrings
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l5.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg3.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>i</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l5.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[1,2,\ldots,n]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[1,2,\ldots,n]</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l5.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg3.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime}=\text{softmax}(\mathcal{P}_{i})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>softmax</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime}=\text{softmax}(\mathcal{P}_{i})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l6.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l6.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Normalize logits to probability distribution
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg3.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{V}_{i}^{\prime}=\text{sort}(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo>=</mo><mrow><mtext>sort</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mo>,</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{V}_{i}^{\prime}=\text{sort}(\mathcal{V},\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l7.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l7.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Sort vocabulary tokens by <math id="alg3.l7.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{P}_{i}^{\prime}</annotation></semantics></math> in descending order
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg3.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg3.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="[1,2,\ldots,K]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>K</mi></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">[1,2,\ldots,K]</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span> <span id="alg3.l8.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Only consider the top-K most likely tokens
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg3.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}=\mathcal{V}_{i}^{\prime}[j]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mrow><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒱</mi><mi>i</mi><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mi>j</mi><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}=\mathcal{V}_{i}^{\prime}[j]</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l9.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l9.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Get <math id="alg3.l9.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="j" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>j</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">j</annotation></semantics></math>-th most probable token
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg3.l10.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\text{isMeaningless}(x_{j})" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mtext>isMeaningless</mtext><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0em">​</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\text{isMeaningless}(x_{j})</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg3.l10.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">continue</span> <span id="alg3.l10.5" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l10.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Skip meaningless tokens, e.g. function words
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l12.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg3.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l12.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="S_{\text{com}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>S</mi><mtext>com</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">S_{\text{com}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l12.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span> <span id="alg3.l12.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span> <span id="alg3.l12.5" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l12.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> <math id="alg3.l12.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> is common to both context and parametric generation
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg3.l14.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l14.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi>C</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg3.l14.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}\notin T_{\text{ctx}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}\notin T_{\text{ctx}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
<span id="alg3.l14.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l14.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Capture contextual knowledge token
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg3.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow P_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{\mathcal{P}_{i,j}^{\prime}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow P_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{\mathcal{P}_{i,j}^{\prime}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow H_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{H_{i}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow H_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{H_{i}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l15.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow T_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{x_{j}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{ctx}}\leftarrow T_{\text{ctx}}\cup\{x_{j}\}</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg3.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l16.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l16.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l17.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg3.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}</annotation></semantics></math> in <math id="alg3.l17.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A_{\text{para}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>A</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A_{\text{para}}</annotation></semantics></math> and <math id="alg3.l17.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="x_{j}\notin T_{\text{para}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>∉</mo><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">x_{j}\notin T_{\text{para}}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg3.l17.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>
<span id="alg3.l17.4" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg3.l17.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Capture parametric knowledge token
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg3.l18.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{para}}\leftarrow P_{\text{para}}\cup\{\mathcal{P}_{i,j}^{\prime}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msubsup><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">𝒫</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>j</mi></mrow><mo>′</mo></msubsup><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{para}}\leftarrow P_{\text{para}}\cup\{\mathcal{P}_{i,j}^{\prime}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l18.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="H_{\text{para}}\leftarrow H_{\text{para}}\cup\{H_{i}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">H_{\text{para}}\leftarrow H_{\text{para}}\cup\{H_{i}\}</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg3.l18.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="T_{\text{para}}\leftarrow T_{\text{para}}\cup\{x_{j}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><msub><mi>T</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><msub><mi>x</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">T_{\text{para}}\leftarrow T_{\text{para}}\cup\{x_{j}\}</annotation></semantics></math>  <span id="alg3.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">break</span>

</div>
<div id="alg3.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg3.l19.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l19.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg3.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg3.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg3.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg3.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg3.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>P</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>ctx</mtext></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mtext>para</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">P_{\text{ctx}},P_{\text{para}},H_{\text{ctx}},H_{\text{para}}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A3" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix C </span>Copy Fragment Detection</h2>

<div id="A3.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The following copy fragment detection algorithm <a href="#alg4" title="Algorithm 4 ‣ Appendix C Copy Fragment Detection ‣ Copy-Paste to Mitigate Large Language Model Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">4</span></a> is adapted from <cite class="ltx_cite ltx_citemacro_citet"><a href="#bib.bib11" title="" class="ltx_ref">Grusky et al. (2018)</a></cite> and included here for completeness of this paper.</p>
</div>
<figure id="alg4" class="ltx_float ltx_float_algorithm ltx_framed ltx_framed_top">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_float"><span id="alg4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Algorithm 4</span> </span> Copy Fragment Detection</figcaption>
<div id="alg4.4" class="ltx_listing ltx_framed ltx_framed_topbottom ltx_listing">
<div id="alg4.l1" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">1:</span>
            
            
          Context sequence <math id="alg4.l1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="C=[c_{0},c_{1},\dots,c_{m-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">C=[c_{0},c_{1},\dots,c_{m-1}]</annotation></semantics></math>; Answer sequence <math id="alg4.l1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="A=[a_{0},a_{1},\dots,a_{n-1}]" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">A=[a_{0},a_{1},\dots,a_{n-1}]</annotation></semantics></math>.

</div>
<div id="alg4.l2" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">2:</span>
            
            
          Set of copy fragments <math id="alg4.l2.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}=\{f_{1},f_{2},\ldots,f_{k}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>f</mi><mi>k</mi></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}=\{f_{1},f_{2},\ldots,f_{k}\}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l3" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">3:</span>
            
            
          <math id="alg4.l3.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}\leftarrow\emptyset" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}\leftarrow\emptyset</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg4.l3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l4" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">4:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg4.l4.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="alg4.l4.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i&lt;n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i&lt;n</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l4.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l5" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">5:</span>
            
            
            <math id="alg4.l5.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\max}\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\max}\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="alg4.l5.m2" class="ltx_math_unparsed" alttext="M\leftarrow\{j\mid j\in[0,m-1],c_{j}=a_{i}\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>M</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mi>j</mi><mo lspace="0em" rspace="0.167em">∣</mo><mi>j</mi><mo>∈</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mi>j</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">M\leftarrow\{j\mid j\in[0,m-1],c_{j}=a_{i}\}</annotation></semantics></math>
<span id="alg4.l5.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg4.l5.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Find all matching positions in context
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l6" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">6:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg4.l6.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span> <math id="alg4.l6.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m\in M" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>M</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m\in M</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l6.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l7" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">7:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg4.l7.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\leftarrow 0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\leftarrow 0</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l8" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">8:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg4.l8.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span> <math id="alg4.l8.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i+\ell&lt;n" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i+\ell&lt;n</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l8.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <math id="alg4.l8.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="m+\ell&lt;m" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">m+\ell&lt;m</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l8.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">and</span> <math id="alg4.l8.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="a_{i+\ell}=c_{m+\ell}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">a_{i+\ell}=c_{m+\ell}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l8.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">do</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l9" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">9:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg4.l9.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell\leftarrow\ell+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell\leftarrow\ell+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l10" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">10:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg4.l10.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg4.l10.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l11" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">11:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg4.l11.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg4.l11.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell&gt;\ell_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell&gt;\ell_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l11.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l12" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">12:</span>
            
            
               <math id="alg4.l12.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\max}\leftarrow\ell" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\max}\leftarrow\ell</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l13" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">13:</span>
            
            
             <span id="alg4.l13.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg4.l13.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l14" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">14:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg4.l14.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg4.l14.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">for</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l15" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">15:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg4.l15.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span> <math id="alg4.l15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\ell_{\max}&gt;0" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\ell_{\max}&gt;0</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l15.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">then</span>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l16" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">16:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg4.l16.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}\leftarrow\mathcal{F}\cup\{[a_{i},a_{i+1},\dots,a_{\ell_{\max}-1}]\}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><mo>∪</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">{</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">[</mo><mrow><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant="normal">…</mi><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mo stretchy="false">]</mo></mrow><mo stretchy="false">}</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}\leftarrow\mathcal{F}\cup\{[a_{i},a_{i+1},\dots,a_{\ell_{\max}-1}]\}</annotation></semantics></math> <span id="alg4.l16.2" class="ltx_text" style="float:right;"><math id="alg4.l16.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\triangleright" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo>⊳</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\triangleright</annotation></semantics></math> Copy the matching subsequnces to fragment set
</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l17" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">17:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg4.l17.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow i+\ell_{\max}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><msub><mi mathvariant="normal">ℓ</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow i+\ell_{\max}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l18" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">18:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg4.l18.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">else</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l19" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">19:</span>
            
            
             <math id="alg4.l19.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="i\leftarrow i+1" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy="false">←</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">i\leftarrow i+1</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
<div id="alg4.l20" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">20:</span>
            
            
            <span id="alg4.l20.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg4.l20.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">if</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l21" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">21:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg4.l21.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">end</span> <span id="alg4.l21.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">while</span>
</div>
<div id="alg4.l22" class="ltx_listingline">
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_listingline">22:</span>
            
            
          <span id="alg4.l22.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">return</span> <math id="alg4.l22.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\mathcal{F}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mi class="ltx_font_mathcaligraphic">ℱ</mi><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\mathcal{F}</annotation></semantics></math>

</div>
</div>
</figure>
</section>
<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Implementation Details</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We fine-tune CopyPasteLLM on three instruction-tuned bases—Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2<span id="footnote1" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">1</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">1</span>
            
            
            
          https://huggingface.co/mistralai/Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2</span></span></span>, LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct<span id="footnote2" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">2</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">2</span>
            
            
            
          https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Meta-Llama-3-8B-Instruct</span></span></span>, and Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct—using<span id="footnote3" class="ltx_note ltx_role_footnote"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup><span class="ltx_note_outer"><span class="ltx_note_content"><sup class="ltx_note_mark">3</sup>
            <span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_note">3</span>
            
            
            
          https://huggingface.co/meta-llama/Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct</span></span></span> Direct Preference Optimization (DPO) with parameter-efficient LoRA adapters, based on responses generated by DeepSeek-V3-0324.
We adapt attention and MLP projections (<span id="A4.p1.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">q_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.2" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">k_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">v_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.4" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">o_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">gate_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.6" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">up_proj</span>, <span id="A4.p1.1.7" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">down_proj</span>) with <math id="A4.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="r=64" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>64</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">r=64</annotation></semantics></math>, <math id="A4.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\alpha=128" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>α</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>128</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\alpha=128</annotation></semantics></math>, and <span id="A4.p1.1.8" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter">dropout</span>=0. Training uses a maximum prompt length of 8192 and a maximum generation length of 1024; the per-device batch size is 2, combined with 8 gradient-accumulation steps. We optimize with AdamW (learning rate 5e-5, weight decay 0.01, max gradient norm 1.0) under a cosine schedule with a 5% warmup and no label smoothing; the DPO temperature is set to <math id="A4.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\beta=0.3" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>β</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0.3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\beta=0.3</annotation></semantics></math>. To balance compute and convergence, we train for 2 epochs on Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.2 and LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct, and for 1 epoch on Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="A5" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix E </span>Experimental Results of CopyPaste-Prompting</h2>

<div id="A5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent">
<p id="A5.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A5.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Appendix E Experimental Results of CopyPaste-Prompting ‣ Copy-Paste to Mitigate Large Language Model Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> compares copying degrees across CopyPaste-Prompting methods and baselines, demonstrating significantly higher copying rates for our approaches. Figure <a href="#A5.F6" title="Figure 6 ‣ Appendix E Experimental Results of CopyPaste-Prompting ‣ Copy-Paste to Mitigate Large Language Model Hallucinations" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">6</span></a> evaluates query relevance using embedding-based similarity, showing that CP-Refine achieves superior relevance compared to CP-Order and CP-Link. Notably, CP-Refine sometimes achieves higher query relevance than the Attributed baseline.</p>
</div>
