<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.10" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.10.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- If copying score <math id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="\leq" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mo style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;" mathcolor="#000000">≤</mo><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">\leq</annotation></semantics></math> {<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.10.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_italic">copying_threshold</span>}, require more context incorporation</span></span>
<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.11" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.11.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Contextual Faithfulness: All facts sourced from context only</span></span>
<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.12" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.12.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Remove any facts or knowledge not in context</span></span>
<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.13" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.13.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Reduce excessive or unnecessary original content</span></span>
<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.14" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.14.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">- Query Relevance: Direct addressing of user query</span></span>
<span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.15" class="ltx_p"><span id="A10.SS1.SSS4.p4.pic1.2.15.1" class="ltx_text" style="--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Provide CONCISE and ACTIONABLE suggestions (max 3 points):</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
